ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/202607202318536449_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/202607202318536449_720.jpg"> </div><p>【世界杯相关】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-21/6a5e5cfd85fafnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">赛后首次发声！梅西：这伤口很难愈合，感谢所有支持，祝贺西班牙</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.24" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210138405324.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.24" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.24" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210138405324.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210138405324.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷决赛0-1不敌西班牙，梅西社媒发文，他表示本届世界杯决赛失利的伤口很难愈合，但同时也向西班牙表示了祝贺。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-21/6a5e509cf1ea2native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">ESPN：世界杯决赛失利，梅西可能重新考虑在国家队的未来</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5d5a7e117d0_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5d5a7e117d0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5d5a7e117d0.jpg"> </div><p>在阿根廷世界杯决赛失利后，ESPN阿根廷记者Luiz Carlos Largo报道了梅西关于国家队未来的消息。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-21/6a5e5e64e3924native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">Factos3.0？C罗社媒点赞西媒称“FIFA想把世界杯送给梅西”的切片</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.15" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210148558832.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.15" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.15" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210148558832_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210148558832_720.jpg"> </div><p>4天前，一家西媒《espejopublico》在官方账号上发布了一条节目切片，其中主持人和嘉宾批评“FIFA腐败，阿根廷早该淘汰”。C罗对这条动态点了赞。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-21/6a5e486e70ea7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">FIFA官方公布世界杯1-48排名：西阿英法前4 挪威5巴西11葡萄牙13</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.51" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5dcd50d2dae_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.51" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.51" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5dcd50d2dae.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5dcd50d2dae.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯已经落幕，FIFA官方在官网公布了本届世界杯48队从第一到第48的最终排名。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-21/6a5e484330108native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">【西班牙夺冠游行】受国王首相接见，近200万人参与，狂欢5.5小时</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.65" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210209536189.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.65" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.65" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210209536189.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210209536189.jpg"> </div><p>西班牙1-0战胜阿根廷夺得世界杯冠军，西班牙队今天举行夺冠庆祝游行，全程历时约5个半小时，总计约200万人参与。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-21/6a5e9138017d7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">决赛染红！恩佐：有些东西远比结果更重要，荣幸成为阿根廷的一员</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.25" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210529292874.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.25" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.25" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210529292874_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210529292874_720.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯决赛，阿根廷加时0-1不敌西班牙无缘卫冕。阿根廷中场恩佐在比赛中染红被提前罚下，赛后他更新了社媒发表征战本届世界杯的感言。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-21/6a5e9bf371f0bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">回击黑粉！德保罗：他们期待阿根廷跌倒，散布毫无根据的阴谋论</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.25" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210611122604.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.25" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.25" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210611122604_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210611122604_720.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯决赛，阿根廷加时0-1不敌西班牙无缘卫冕。赛后，德保罗更新了社媒。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-21/6a5e742ec281enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">FIFA官方晒最新TOP10：冠军西班牙登顶！2-4阿法英 墨西哥进前十</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210319468615.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210319468615.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/202607210319468615.jpg"> </div><p>FIFA世界杯官方账号晒出本届世界杯之后，FIFA最新排名TOP10球队以及他们各自的排名变动情况。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-21/6a5e4a35a634enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世界杯ins涨粉榜：哈兰德第1沃齐尼亚第2 C罗第4内马尔第6梅西第7</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.55" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260713/6a54a23d72606_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.55" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.55" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260713/6a54a23d72606.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260713/6a54a23d72606.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯落幕，数据机构Sportico统计了本届世界杯参赛球员在ins上的涨粉量排行。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-21/6a5e544c921f1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">BBC：FIFA最初报告帕雷德斯赛后染红 不久后这张红牌从记录中删除</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5dd632f1105_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5dd632f1105.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5dd632f1105.jpg"> </div><p>BBC消息，帕雷德斯赛后的红牌随后不久便从记录中删除，目前没有任何证据表明当时采取了任何纪律处分。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-21/6a5e70738c5f9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">FIFA官方：纪律委员会将就阿根廷vs西班牙赛后冲突展开调查</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.57" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5d97720850b_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.57" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.57" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5d97720850b_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5d97720850b_720.jpg"> </div><p>FIFA官方消息，纪律委员会将调查阿根廷vs西班牙赛后冲突，以确认是否存在违规情况。</p><p>【凯文·基冈去世】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-20/6a5e2ff0f1ee0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">R.I.P.🕯️英格兰足球传奇凯文·基冈因癌症去世，享年75岁</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/202607202239187825.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="backgroun